  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-610-625">春の弥生の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-625-637"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-637-640">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-640-655"><rb>仄</rb><rt>ほの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-655-660">に</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-660-684"><rb>天地</rb><rt>あめつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-684-693">ひくゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-693-705"><rb>垂</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-705-722">れあひて、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-722-740"><rb>情</rb><rt>なさけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740-769">のにほひいちめんに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-769-807">おぼろおぼろの花ぐもり、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-807-834"><rb>精舎</rb><rt>しやうじや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-834-843">の壁の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-843-870"><rb>地獄絵</rb><rt>ぢごくゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-870-875">も</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-875-890"><rb>温</rb><rt>ぬる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-890-893">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-893-911"><rb>霞</rb><rt>かすみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-911-914">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-914-929"><rb>纏</rb><rt>まと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-929-945">ふらむ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-945-974">森の木立の月かげを</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-974-998">避けて、まぶかき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-998-1022"><rb>黒鉄</rb><rt>くろがね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1022-1027">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1027-1045"><rb>甲</rb><rt>かぶと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1045-1060">に、なほも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1060-1084"><rb>色白</rb><rt>いろじろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1084-1089">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1089-1107"><rb>面</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1107-1125"><rb>凛々</rb><rt>りゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125-1134">しく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1134-1161"><rb>瑠璃青</rb><rt>るりあを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1161-1166">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1166-1184"><rb>瞳</rb><rt>ひとみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1184-1213">きよげに、花ぐさを</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1213-1234">わけつゝしのぶ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1234-1252"><rb>騎士</rb><rt>きし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1252-1268">ひとり。</seg></p>
      <p>『たそがれがたの<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1292-1316"><rb>戦闘</rb><rt>たゝかひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1316-1321">に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1321-1353">十騎の敵を殺したれ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1353-1371">胸にさしたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1371-1401"><rb>紅薔薇</rb><rt>べにさうび</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1403-1406">二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1406-1424"><rb>輪</rb><rt>りん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1424-1439"><rb>色</rb><rt>いろ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1439-1451"><rb>濃</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1451-1474">くちりもせず、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1474-1489"><rb>西</rb><rt>にし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1489-1492">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1492-1507"><rb>丘</rb><rt>おか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1507-1516">なる陣</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1516-1531"><rb>指</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1531-1542">すと、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1542-1557"><rb>悠</rb><rt>ゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1557-1588">に見かへる敵の城。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1588-1626">時しもあれや、矢は一つ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1626-1647"><rb>空鳴</rb><rt>そらな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1647-1682">りしつつ、ひとばかり、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1682-1714">鎧の袖に触れて落つ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1714-1749">赤き塗り矢の根のかたに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1749-1787">如何なる人のざれわざぞ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1787-1824">にくき文こそ結びたれ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1824-1827">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1827-1845"><rb>貪</rb><rt>むさぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1845-1863">るものにこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1863-1881"><rb>穢土</rb><rt>ゑど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1881-1886">は</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1886-1921">あはれみ給へ、将軍よ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1921-1953">少女が胸のなさけには</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1953-1974"><rb>国土</rb><rt>こくど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1974-1977">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1977-1998"><rb>山河</rb><rt>さんが</rt></ruby>も何ならむ。』</p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2021-2042">とばかり読むも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2042-2066"><rb>短檠</rb><rt>たんけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2066-2071">の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2071-2114">火かげまばゆくおぼえしか。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2114-2155">まだ我が知らぬ酔ひごこち、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2155-2193">こは夢かとて立ちよれば、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2193-2228">壁に懸けたる我が盾に、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2228-2246">うつれる影は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2246-2270"><rb>怨敵</rb><rt>をんてき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2270-2275">の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2275-2304">かなたの王の一の姫</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2304-2319">乱れし髪の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2319-2405"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-91-26" source="#source-2319-2393">﨟</g></rb><rt>らふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2405-2421">たしや。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2421-2436"><rb>癡</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2436-2439">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2439-2451"><rb>果</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2451-2477">てじと投げぬれば</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2477-2509">盾は音して砕けたり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2509-2541">第二の盾を手にとりて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2541-2582">見ればここにも不思議さよ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2582-2600">うつれる姫は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2600-2624"><rb>浮足</rb><rt>うけあし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2624-2629">に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2629-2664">わが前にしも身を投げて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2664-2704">よゝとばかりに縋り泣く。</seg></p>
      <p>『あゝよし、さらば<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2731-2755"><rb>天地</rb><rt>あめつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2755-2760">も</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2760-2784"><rb>有情</rb><rt>うじやう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2784-2799"><rb>温</rb><rt>ぬる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2799-2819">みの春の夜の</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2819-2837">花のくもりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2837-2849"><rb>溶</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2849-2863">け去りて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2863-2895">一如無相の海となれ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2895-2901">愛の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2901-2922"><rb>御龕</rb><rt>みづし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2922-2934">に、姫が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2934-2946"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2946-2954">に、</seg></p>
      <p>いまぞ楽しき罪を得む。』</p>
      <p><seg source="#source-2994-3000">城の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3000-3015"><rb>濠</rb><rt>ほり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3015-3021">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3021-3045"><rb>切崖</rb><rt>きりぎし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3045-3050">も</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3050-3085">夢の心地にくゞり来て、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3085-3120">瞳すかせば、木がくれに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3120-3141">さやさやとなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3141-3165"><rb>衣摺</rb><rt>きぬずれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3165-3173">や、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3173-3179">姫は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3179-3200"><rb>荒磯</rb><rt>ありそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3200-3220">のこほろぎの</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3220-3232"><rb>藻</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3232-3272">によるごとくすがりけり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3272-3278">花の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3278-3290"><rb>木</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3290-3293">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3293-3305"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3305-3325">にうぐひすは</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3325-3360">夢の世をしも歌ひたり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3360-3392">蜜の如くにやはらかき</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3392-3401">うまし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3401-3422"><rb>二人</rb><rt>ふたり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3422-3445">のくちづけよ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3445-3451">あゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3451-3475"><rb>怨敵</rb><rt>をんてき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3475-3489">と怨敵は</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3489-3504"><rb>天</rb><rt>あめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3504-3516">と歴史を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3516-3528"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3528-3547">みしつる。</seg></p>
      <p>『青史の<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3559-3574"><rb>帙</rb><rt>ちつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3574-3577">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3577-3598"><rb>御座</rb><rt>みくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3598-3606">する</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3606-3644">神もいまさば、などてこの</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3644-3668"><rb>戦闘</rb><rt>たゝかひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3668-3694">あらぬ初めより、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3694-3715"><rb>怨恨</rb><rt>うらみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3715-3741">をむすぶ敵軍に、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3741-3762">かゝるくしびの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3762-3780"><rb>力</rb><rt>ちから</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3780-3788">もつ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3788-3806">姫ありとしも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3806-3818"><rb>告</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby>げざりし。』</p>
      <p>『みゆるしたまへ、父の王、</p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3881-3893"><rb>汝</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3893-3911">がいとし子の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3911-3926"><rb>魂</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3926-3934">の花</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-3934-3975">咲きくゆりぬる功徳のゆゑ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3975-3993"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3993-3999">より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3999-4014"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4014-4034">のたゝかひに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4034-4040">王が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4040-4061"><rb>馬蹄</rb><rt>ばてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4061-4067">は十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4067-4085"><rb>国</rb><rt>こく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4085-4090">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4090-4105"><rb>土</rb><rt>つち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4105-4108">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4108-4123"><rb>隈</rb><rt>くま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4123-4129">なく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4129-4144"><rb>印</rb><rt>しる</rt></ruby>しなむ。』</p>
      <p>『王よ與へむ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4184-4199"><rb>天</rb><rt>あめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4199-4202">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4202-4217"><rb>下</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4217-4222">、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4222-4234"><rb>汝</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4234-4237">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4237-4261"><rb>利心</rb><rt>とごゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4261-4264">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4264-4276"><rb>飽</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4276-4293">くまゝに、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4293-4302">血汐に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4302-4314"><rb>餓</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4314-4320">うる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4320-4335"><rb>戈</rb><rt>ほこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4335-4349">さきを、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4349-4370"><rb>十国</rb><rt>とくに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4370-4382">の城に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4382-4406"><rb>百国</rb><rt>もゝくに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4406-4411">の</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4411-4426"><rb>民</rb><rt>たみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4426-4429">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4429-4447"><rb>頭</rb><rt>かうべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4447-4467">に、柔らかう</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4467-4494">口づけさせて、取り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4494-4506"><rb>統</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby>べよ。』</p>
      <p>『国の王者にあらずとも、</p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4560-4569">かゝる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4569-4587"><rb>雄々</rb><rt>をゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4587-4604">しき恋人は</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4604-4622"><rb>真</rb><rt>まこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4622-4648">の人ぞ、あゝ今は</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4648-4657">われも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4657-4675"><rb>真</rb><rt>まこと</rt></ruby>の人の妻。』</p>
      <p><seg source="#source-4695-4727">二人をめぐるそよ風は</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4727-4748"><rb>百千</rb><rt>もつち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-4748-4775">の花の香を吹きぬ。</seg></p>
    </body>
